        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor: consolidate generic number clamps",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe first number-coercion consolidation pass in #99671 migrated finite-number and integer option callers, but generic inclusive clamp mechanics still had a legacy implementation in `src/utils.ts` plus exact local copies in agents and the Control UI.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis makes `@openclaw/normalization-core/number-coercion` the canonical owner for policy-free numeric clamping and removes exact local copies. The existing `clamp`, `clampInt`, and `clampNumber` function declarations remain in `src/utils.ts` as a published compatibility facade and delegate to normalization-core; keeping those declarations also preserves the plugin SDK callable-surface contract. Finite-number validation in the touched Control UI path now uses the existing canonical helper. Units, defaults, fallback/error policy, domain bounds, retry policy, and semantic sentinels remain local.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended user-visible behavior change. The same inclusive bounds and integer-flooring contracts now share one implementation while current plugin SDK exports remain unchanged.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Reproduced the prior exact-head CI failure from `checks-node-compact-small-whole-2`: `test/scripts/plugin-sdk-surface-report.test.ts` detected six missing callable facade declarations.\n- Fixed tooling contract: `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs test/scripts/plugin-sdk-surface-report.test.ts`\n  - Result: 1 shard passed; 8 tests passed.\n- Focused callers: `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs packages/normalization-core/src/number-coercion.test.ts src/utils.test.ts src/logging/log-tail.test.ts src/agents/memory-search.test.ts src/auto-reply/reply/bash-command.stop.test.ts src/agents/code-mode.test.ts src/agents/agent-tools.create-openclaw-coding-tools.adds-claude-style-aliases-schemas-without-dropping-g.test.ts ui/src/ui/chat/grouped-render.test.ts`\n  - Result: 7 Vitest shards passed; 212 tests passed.\n- Testbox-through-Crabbox: `tbx_01kwnk58e0c08hhkyhypb7aw5h`, Actions run `28693714269`, exit 0.\n  - `pnpm check:changed` passed core production/test typechecks, lint with zero warnings/errors, guards, duplicate coverage, and import-cycle checks.\n  - Full `pnpm build` passed, including plugin SDK export validation and Control UI build.\n- Fresh exact-branch autoreview: clean, no accepted/actionable findings; correctness confidence 0.98.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- Production LOC: 32 additions, 31 deletions; net +1. The compatibility facade accounts for the one-line growth while duplicate local clamp bodies are removed.\n",
